    "summary": "A lily native to China, Japan, Korea and the Russian Far East. It has showy orange-and-black, scentless flowers and produces small bulbs in its leaf joints that can grow into cloned plants. In Asia, its bulbs are cultivated and gathered from the wild for food; in Taiwan, the flowers are also eaten.",
